{"concept":"ring","groups":[{"id":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","name":{"ru":"Свивание, окружение и борьба","en":"Coiling, surrounding and struggle"},"count":12},{"id":"self-return","name":{"ru":"Кольцо возвращения к себе","en":"The ring of self-return"},"count":4},{"id":"wedding-refrain","name":{"ru":"Брачный рефрен возвращения","en":"Recurrence’s wedding refrain"},"count":7}],"occurrences":[{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.01","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e","tos.text-unit.sid-bafc518840cda4af3ce9098305fdb45e"]},"form":"geringelt","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["great-noon","identity","attention","circle","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Полдень открывает союз кружащего орла и обвившей его змеи.","en":"Noon reveals the bond of the circling eagle and coiled snake."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.02","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-809fcf08ae8596c639eb00b4b2ddb4a4","tos.text-unit.sid-809fcf08ae8596c639eb00b4b2ddb4a4"]},"form":"ringen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["will","becoming","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лев ищет последнего господина для решающей борьбы.","en":"The lion seeks its last master for a decisive struggle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.06","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-672bbf6bfad618116a90a96c7ddd9493","tos.text-unit.sid-672bbf6bfad618116a90a96c7ddd9493"]},"form":"umringt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Ревность окружает человека и обращает его жало на себя.","en":"Jealousy surrounds a person and turns their sting inward."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.17","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f48512263377ab51fdd46c9397cb9c5d","tos.text-unit.sid-f48512263377ab51fdd46c9397cb9c5d"]},"form":"Ringen","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"self-return","neighbours":["becoming","wheel","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Мир друга вновь собирается кольцами становления целей из случая.","en":"The friend’s world gathers again in rings of purposes becoming from chance."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.22","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0b0fa119613dfa801866291beb04d934","tos.text-unit.sid-0b0fa119613dfa801866291beb04d934"]},"form":"umringt","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Завершивший дело умирает среди надеющихся и обещающих.","en":"The fulfilled one dies among those who hope and promise."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"I.23","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-0ffe99fde73fa5eaa81da967507c8faf","tos.text-unit.sid-0ffe99fde73fa5eaa81da967507c8faf"]},"form":"ringelte","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["will"],"line":{"ru":"Подарок учеников соединяет змею и солнце на золотой рукояти.","en":"The disciples’ gift joins snake and sun on a golden handle."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.05","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f4983af7e51ecdbbc86ad80024a075ac","tos.text-unit.sid-f4983af7e51ecdbbc86ad80024a075ac"]},"form":"Ringes","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"self-return","neighbours":["identity","body-self","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любимая добродетель несёт жажду кольца вернуться к себе.","en":"Beloved virtue bears the ring’s thirst to return to itself."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.07","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-a9f262e8a6a9728c71878809db9d0293","tos.text-unit.sid-a9f262e8a6a9728c71878809db9d0293"]},"form":"Ringkampfe","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Своды храма изображают божественную борьбу света и тени.","en":"The temple’s arches picture a divine struggle of light and shade."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5e900c37b7c4778d6e4c9a5c4d896131","tos.text-unit.sid-5e900c37b7c4778d6e4c9a5c4d896131"]},"form":"Ringelwurm","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["identity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Божественная маска прикрывает телесное желание.","en":"A divine mask covers bodily desire."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.15","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-86cf91e9b1683fb8239ab9fdf7c4de2c","tos.text-unit.sid-86cf91e9b1683fb8239ab9fdf7c4de2c"]},"form":"Schlangengeringel","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Созерцательная маска скрывает змеиное свивание.","en":"The contemplative mask conceals a coiling of snakes."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"II.20","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7c1ded9bb2862ae4e10daac0083b0c86","tos.text-unit.sid-7c1ded9bb2862ae4e10daac0083b0c86"]},"form":"umringten","speaker":"narrator","addressee":"","mode":"narration","use":"narration","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["rope-bridge"],"line":{"ru":"Горбун обращается к учителю среди окружающих калек.","en":"The hunchback addresses the teacher among the surrounding disabled people."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.04","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-626a1ddc2cb92d98694643a211ca18de","tos.text-unit.sid-626a1ddc2cb92d98694643a211ca18de"]},"form":"Ringer","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["becoming","affirmation","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Борьба освобождает руки для благословения.","en":"Struggle frees the hands for blessing."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.13","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-f6f69805abb8029bbedef25eeb121721","tos.text-unit.sid-f6f69805abb8029bbedef25eeb121721"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"animals","addressee":"zarathustra","mode":"speech","use":"image","group":"self-return","neighbours":["becoming","identity","animals"],"line":{"ru":"Кольцо бытия хранит верность через разрыв и встречу.","en":"Being’s ring remains faithful through parting and reunion."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-5af9e1110a7579a7427c94403f629e85","tos.text-unit.sid-5af9e1110a7579a7427c94403f629e85"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к вечности желает брачного кольца возвращения.","en":"Love of eternity desires recurrence’s wedding ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-7025b70b3601d6be561be376b86dd8b6","tos.text-unit.sid-7025b70b3601d6be561be376b86dd8b6"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","identity","body-self","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Любовь к открытому небу ведёт к кольцу возвращения.","en":"Love of the open sky leads to recurrence’s ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-063aff5811136de165528da99a7e5f9a","tos.text-unit.sid-063aff5811136de165528da99a7e5f9a"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Сотворение и игра вновь завершаются желанием кольца.","en":"Creating and play again culminate in desiring the ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-c305550ba9a5c876ec0427561feb3a17","tos.text-unit.sid-c305550ba9a5c876ec0427561feb3a17"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Открытость противоположностей вновь зовёт кольцо возвращения.","en":"Openness to opposites calls recurrence’s ring again."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1fbbc1d2dc76e9983699708bfe22b0a1","tos.text-unit.sid-1fbbc1d2dc76e9983699708bfe22b0a1"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Море и поиск вновь приводят к брачному кольцу вечности.","en":"Sea and seeking lead again to eternity’s wedding ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-745a62dbd7262ad9b8c0aa47c1262130","tos.text-unit.sid-745a62dbd7262ad9b8c0aa47c1262130"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Лёгкость танца вновь желает кольца возвращения.","en":"Dance’s lightness again desires recurrence’s ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"III.16","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-1a2dcbf6c21d6c29e6bacdc6370af6ba","tos.text-unit.sid-1a2dcbf6c21d6c29e6bacdc6370af6ba"]},"form":"Ring","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"eternity","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"wedding-refrain","neighbours":["recurrence","eternity","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Птичья свобода песни вновь зовёт кольцо возвращения.","en":"Song’s birdlike freedom again calls recurrence’s ring."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-d079df46a2ee3db16622a4025a7ca880","tos.text-unit.sid-d079df46a2ee3db16622a4025a7ca880"]},"form":"ringe","speaker":"magician","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"speech","use":"song","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["will","magician"],"line":{"ru":"Чародей уступает своему злому духу час песни.","en":"The magician grants his evil spirit the hour of song."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.14","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-eb0c773a9f15394bb19d5e177c244834","tos.text-unit.sid-eb0c773a9f15394bb19d5e177c244834"]},"form":"ringeln","speaker":"magician","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"coiling-surrounding-struggle","neighbours":["courage","will","becoming","identity","memory","attention","laughter","body-self","rope-bridge","earth","magician"],"line":{"ru":"Песнь чародея вспоминает жажду истины через образы хищной поэзии.","en":"The magician’s song recalls thirst for truth through predatory images of poetry."}},{"cite":{"w":"also-sprach-zarathustra","c":"IV.19","u":["tos.text-unit.sid-4c6965df3cda4fac17ddff4d6b911a29","tos.text-unit.sid-4c6965df3cda4fac17ddff4d6b911a29"]},"form":"Ringes","speaker":"zarathustra","addressee":"higher-men","mode":"song","use":"song","group":"self-return","neighbours":["will","bite","joy-lust","zarathustra"],"line":{"ru":"Радость кусает себя и несёт волю кольца.","en":"Joy bites itself and bears the ring’s will."}}]}
